==Battleground==
*2 [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory Dark]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Dark Dober]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Dogenstein]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
**10 [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
**1 [[Oldhorn]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Kill the two Dogensteins, then stall the Gory Dark with [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser Cat]] and [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]]. Once you've saved up enough cash, kill Gory Dark with [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] for the Double Bounty. Start pushing towards the enemy base with [[Talents|Talented]] [[Dom Cat (Special Cat)|Dark Lazers]]; when Can Can reaches the enemy base and triggers the boss, unleash [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]].

Ideally, Uril should be able to keep Oldhorn perpetually slowed while you slowly whittle away at Dark Dober. The peons shouldn't be too big of a problem as long as you keep spawning meatshields.

==='''Recommended Units'''===
*[[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Master of Life Dr. Nova]]: With both Sage Slayer and Curse Immunity, Nova can slow every enemy on this stage with the exception of Dogenstein.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Celestial Child Luna (Uber Rare Cat)|Salvation's Daughter Lunacia]]: Her Wave Shield protects any non Weaken-Immune backliners, and she Freezes Oldhorn, making her a good choice to bring.

